WEBVTT

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:25.900
Peace Planet, Peace Land.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:28.070
This peace was destroyed in the blink of an eye by Garga, the Demon Planet.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:34.800
Peace Land was destroyed.

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:37.720
The Peace Land Seijin lost a lot of their land.

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:39.900
They all took the Pandora Capsule.

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:41.080
They wanted a peaceful planet.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:42.400
That's why they became meteorites.

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:46.150
Garga, who aimed to conquer the Earth,

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:47.770
built a space fortress.

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:49.310
He aimed for the Earth with the Kyōjū Missile.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:58.840
The Earth is the only family of the Capsule with the meteorites.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:04.170
They fought against Galaga Seijin as new earthlings.

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:07.340
The name of their family is the Ryusei Ningen Zone.

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:08.970
Zone Fight!

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:38.120
I'll cut your head off and fly to you

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:56.520
I'll be waiting for you, my friend

00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:59.980
I'll be waiting for you, my friend

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:05.600
The red object. It's finally here, Father.

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:06.870
Yes, it's here.

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:08.110
What is it?

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:10.050
It's Garoga.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:11.670
What? Garoga?

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:14.160
Yes. They have a desire to rule the universe.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:18.730
That's why they're trying to take over all the planets in the universe.

00:03:20.390 --> 00:03:26.620
The first sacrifice was our life in Peace Land.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:27.440
Yes.

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:32.690
We won't let them take over this planet if we keep it that way, will we?

00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:36.520
That's right. We've come this far to be able to live with everyone.

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:38.110
Right, Akira-chan?

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:41.990
Yes. We've made a lot of friends, but we can't afford to lose to Garga or something like that.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:47.130
It's Garga!

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:49.820
Hey, Hikaru-san.

00:03:49.940 --> 00:03:52.930
We're the only ones who know their true identity, right?

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:56.930
I think our family is the first target they're aiming for on Earth.

00:03:58.170 --> 00:03:59.970
That's why...

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:03.110
Don't let the Earthlings worry you.

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:06.270
Keep the red object you saw a secret.

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:07.920
Of course.

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:12.040
We'll keep an eye on him.

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:16.240
He must have disappeared.

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:23.110
It's done.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:24.540
Really?

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:26.120
Yes.

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:29.450
When the kids are about to fall...

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:35.230
In other words, you're trying to prevent her from falling off the bed.

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:37.380
Well, that's right.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:40.290
You idiot! Think of a more dreamy toy!

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:41.870
Dreamy?

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:47.990
I was aiming to make her dream a good dream until morning.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.220
Hello, Junichi-kun.

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:03.640
Hello.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:06.500
It's a shame you came to play.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:08.720
You're going to swim in Summerland from now on.

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:13.720
Then, I...

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:18.440
Is your mother at home?

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:19.700
She went out.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.290
It's so cold.

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:23.800
My father went golfing.

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:24.840
He's not here.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:28.520
Junichi-san, welcome.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:34.260
Hotaru-san, why don't you take Junichi-san with you?

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:34.860
Sure!

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:39.450
Can you swim? It's the first time this year!

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:29.850
you

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:33.380
Hurry up, please.

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:57.690
It hasn't been moved, has it?

00:06:57.790 --> 00:06:58.840
No, it's fine.

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:40.920
This must be a part of a monster.

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:12.350
It's really a nuisance to take Junichi out of the house.

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:16.120
I'm going to play with Akira and Hotaru at Summerland.

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:20.220
I'm sorry. I was so lonely.

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:22.100
It's a waste of time.

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:24.620
Junichi has a lot of money.

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:31.290
Excuse me.

00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:35.110
It's Sakimori.

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:38.380
What? Hotaru and the others?

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:38.780
Yes.

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:45.190
It's a car accident. Are the three of you okay?

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:53.890
Thank you.

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:57.780
The car will be here any minute, so please take care of it.

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:20.400
Jirazone Fighter

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:38.310
Put your hands up and get out!

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:03.950
Not yet?

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:33.500
This is Milifer from Land 2P. This is Zone Fighter.

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:35.180
He's in the trunk of the car.

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:39.900
He'll take you to their hideout, like Garoga.

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:44.430
I don't know what traps they'll use, so please follow me.

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:50.180
And that phone call...

00:10:50.180 --> 00:10:52.380
It's their trap.

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:55.690
Alright, get them out of here.

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:57.560
If it's Garoga, kill him.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:10:58.910
Yes, sir.

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:01.460
Ryusei Ningen Zone!

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:17.330
When the Cloud Zone Family gathers,

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:19.370
we'll kill them all at once.

00:11:20.520 --> 00:11:22.920
They're the only ones who know our true identity.

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:26.170
We'll get in the way of the rescue.

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:29.960
Roger that, Zone Fa...

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.820
I'll make sure to kill all the members of the family.

00:11:32.140 --> 00:11:33.130
All right.

00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:37.990
I'll also launch a sniper missile for rescue.

00:11:39.310 --> 00:11:41.360
Yoruba.

00:11:41.480 --> 00:11:43.050
Yes, sir.

00:11:44.440 --> 00:11:44.620
Fire!

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:46.180
Roger that.

00:12:08.480 --> 00:12:09.200
Is this the crime scene?

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:15.310
Yes. We'll let the kids see it, so get off.

00:13:00.730 --> 00:13:09.060
Hey, calm down.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:32.540
Now, the Zou family is all here.

00:13:33.860 --> 00:13:37.950
Although, there are some strange things going on between them.

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:38.830
Please!

00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:18.980
It's a ZO-HITER! We'll get rid of him!

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:19.780
Roger that!

00:14:46.604 --> 00:14:47.364
All good.

00:14:48.492 --> 00:14:48.792
Yeah.

00:15:30.764 --> 00:15:31.264
HELLO!

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:24.660
I'm going to call you Zon Great.

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:29.170
The zonemeter shows the amount of energy and consumes the power.

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:32.330
When the meter turns red, in 110 seconds,

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:34.530
the Zone Fighter becomes completely powerless.

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:35.690
Yes.

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:29.220
It has a powerful magnetic force that can absorb 5,000 tons of metal.

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:59.870
This is a rescue plane hidden in the space of the first dimension, Mach 8.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:00.420
at a speed of 50.

00:21:31.280 --> 00:21:51.100
I have to fill up the energy of the fighter while I'm at it.

00:22:30.316 --> 00:22:30.536
Thank you.

00:22:30.668 --> 00:22:31.168
Well, I...

00:23:22.140 --> 00:23:25.260
If only we could be happy, we wouldn't have to worry about others.

00:23:25.280 --> 00:23:28.070
I'm sorry, but I'm sorry for what happened today.

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:32.360
I will take care of your family and live with my parents.

00:23:34.340 --> 00:23:37.640
No, no, it's too embarrassing to say that.

00:23:38.460 --> 00:23:40.820
I'm so glad you're here, Tenchi.

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:46.640
Come on, let's go.

00:23:46.880 --> 00:23:49.080
So, the Earth has been evacuated.

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:53.020
But the Garama Seijin's ambition to invade the Earth hasn't disappeared.

00:23:53.860 --> 00:23:55.620
Moreover, they have launched several hypersonic missiles.

00:23:58.110 --> 00:23:59.570
When, where, and how did they explode?

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:03.170
Will the Zon Family be able to defeat them?

00:24:03.550 --> 00:24:20.270
Garga tries to trap them even harder.

00:24:20.710 --> 00:24:22.210
The girl shines brightly in Garga's hands.

00:24:24.440 --> 00:24:25.460
Distrokin appears.

00:24:25.500 --> 00:24:29.210
The Zon Fighter is also very active.

00:24:31.760 --> 00:24:33.520
Stay tuned for the next episode of Yatsukero! Destroking!
